verify_instructions	db	'    This option controls the Verify After Write feature of the system'
	db	0h
	db	'Diskette software.  When enabled, the Diskette is verified after each'
	db	0h
	db	'write operation, with automatic retries for verification errors.  The'
	db	0h
	db	'Verify feature results in greater data security at the cost of speed.'
